{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A heart-wrenching adventure</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finding his wife\u2019s lifeless body, Jack is ambushed by a demon\u2026 and forced to defend himself with the knife that killed her. A knife that now whispers in her voice. Embark on a journey of vengeance in a world where nothing is as it seems, with diabolical darkness roiling beneath every surface. Can you unveil the truth, or will you become a mere pawn in an ancient game?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/b5536ebc3b8b4b2d00514cad963777f5.poster.avif?t=1772765423\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/b5536ebc3b8b4b2d00514cad963777f5.webm?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/b5536ebc3b8b4b2d00514cad963777f5.mp4?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Razor-sharp gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards from your deck to empower one of three actions: Attack, Defend, and Prepare. A total of 21 produces exceptional results, but going over is a Bust, and will forfeit your action. An arsenal of modifiers, backgrounds, and items allows you to build a unique deck and master a play-style that is completely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/191dd7bf615fc3109b3d601173a5b108.poster.avif?t=1772765423\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/191dd7bf615fc3109b3d601173a5b108.webm?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/191dd7bf615fc3109b3d601173a5b108.mp4?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Follow the clues</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabjack features multiple cases with immersive investigation sequences. Examine grisly wounds and environmental damage, then use your intellect and intuition to find the culprit. Only you can bring the demons to justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/1d33b192a68eca6c6af3844d065b2f4a.poster.avif?t=1772765423\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/1d33b192a68eca6c6af3844d065b2f4a.webm?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/1d33b192a68eca6c6af3844d065b2f4a.mp4?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Stabjack is a treat for the eyes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly rendered art will make you feel like you\u2019re walking through the pages of a comic book. However, combat is where Stabjack really shines! First-person knife-fights with crisp animation and dramatic camera movements create an unbelievable sense of tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/2dabcb9704eb38c2765a9527d4b6aaa6.poster.avif?t=1772765423\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/2dabcb9704eb38c2765a9527d4b6aaa6.webm?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/2dabcb9704eb38c2765a9527d4b6aaa6.mp4?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Experience a tragic tale of revenge\u2026 or not</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabjack is a story-rich game filled with shocking surprises and memorable characters\u2026 But sometimes, you just want to slam cards. A simple checkbox disables the majority of text that\u2019s not relevant to battles. Don\u2019t worry: you can play through the story anytime.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913420?t=1772765423","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/947ed72870c0802bf72071962fd80239f648b02e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772765423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/ed73e54fa82ebe385308a3ec8aa8949fa33c6bbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772765423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/ed73e54fa82ebe385308a3ec8aa8949fa33c6bbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772765423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Stabjack contains stylized depictions of violence, including first-person knife fights, blood splatter, depictions of injury. The game also features investigations of murder scenes and themes involving death, revenge, and psychological trauma.\r\n\r\nAlthough the style is comic-noir and not realistic, some players may find these images intense or disturbing."},"demos":[{"appid":3980420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A heart-wrenching adventure</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finding his wife\u2019s lifeless body, Jack is ambushed by a demon\u2026 and forced to defend himself with the knife that killed her. A knife that now whispers in her voice. Embark on a journey of vengeance in a world where nothing is as it seems, with diabolical darkness roiling beneath every surface. Can you unveil the truth, or will you become a mere pawn in an ancient game?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/b5536ebc3b8b4b2d00514cad963777f5.poster.avif?t=1772765423\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/b5536ebc3b8b4b2d00514cad963777f5.webm?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/b5536ebc3b8b4b2d00514cad963777f5.mp4?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Razor-sharp gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards from your deck to empower one of three actions: Attack, Defend, and Prepare. A total of 21 produces exceptional results, but going over is a Bust, and will forfeit your action. An arsenal of modifiers, backgrounds, and items allows you to build a unique deck and master a play-style that is completely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/191dd7bf615fc3109b3d601173a5b108.poster.avif?t=1772765423\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/191dd7bf615fc3109b3d601173a5b108.webm?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/191dd7bf615fc3109b3d601173a5b108.mp4?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Follow the clues</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabjack features multiple cases with immersive investigation sequences. Examine grisly wounds and environmental damage, then use your intellect and intuition to find the culprit. Only you can bring the demons to justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/1d33b192a68eca6c6af3844d065b2f4a.poster.avif?t=1772765423\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/1d33b192a68eca6c6af3844d065b2f4a.webm?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/1d33b192a68eca6c6af3844d065b2f4a.mp4?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Stabjack is a treat for the eyes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly rendered art will make you feel like you\u2019re walking through the pages of a comic book. However, combat is where Stabjack really shines! First-person knife-fights with crisp animation and dramatic camera movements create an unbelievable sense of tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/2dabcb9704eb38c2765a9527d4b6aaa6.poster.avif?t=1772765423\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/2dabcb9704eb38c2765a9527d4b6aaa6.webm?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/extras/2dabcb9704eb38c2765a9527d4b6aaa6.mp4?t=1772765423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Experience a tragic tale of revenge\u2026 or not</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabjack is a story-rich game filled with shocking surprises and memorable characters\u2026 But sometimes, you just want to slam cards. A simple checkbox disables the majority of text that\u2019s not relevant to battles. Don\u2019t worry: you can play through the story anytime.</p>","developers":["Cosmic Cog LLC","Sea Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913420/ee0533083613d6c522bd58694b5d7ef76fc9c40d/header.jpg?t=1772765423","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3913420/1125717322/485edce750201eca83ac1a1136a31447d271ae52/1769356868/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769357506","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3913420/1125717322/485edce750201eca83ac1a1136a31447d271ae52/1769356868/dash_h2